# This repo is the record of a byte-for-byte direct-upload deploy to Cloudflare
# Pages. Git must never translate line endings: a checkout has to reproduce the
# bytes that were uploaded, on any platform.
#
# Before this file existed, core.autocrlf=true meant a fresh clone differed from
# the deployed tree on 46 of 88 files (line endings only, no content change),
# which makes the repo useless as a byte-level deploy source.
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion and overrides core.autocrlf.
* -text
